WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.567
Halves and quarters

2
00:00:03.567 --> 00:00:09.000
Mother shares injera with the family. Everyone should get an equal share.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.567
When we cut the injera into two equal parts, each part is a half.

4
00:00:13.567 --> 00:00:17.467
Into four equal parts, each part is a quarter.

5
00:00:17.467 --> 00:00:20.733
The parts must be equal.
